Additional imported resources and paths (same revision):
- desk/icons.c: original 32x32 hard disk/floppy/folder/trash mask/data.
- bios/fnt_st_8x16.c: original 256-character font, transposed to glyph-major data.
- vdi/vdi_line.c: WM_REPLACE swblit_rect_common with 68000 DBRA loop and solid vertical_line.
- vdi/vdi_fill.c: DITHER patterns 2 and 4.
- aes/gemwmlib.c: W_CLOSER/W_SIZER character IDs and active W_NAME pattern.
- desk/deskapp.c: default mono/colour background style.
- vdi/vdi_col.c: ST RGB palette values; our hardware pen indices retain black=0/white=1.
