VOFA/ET4000 adaptation (v8)
-------------------------
system/vofa_et4000.c adapts the ET4000/Volksfarben portions and VGA register
tables from bios/nova.c, Christian Zietz and the EmuTOS development team,
Copyright 2018-2025, GPL-2.0-or-later. Source consulted 2026-09-16:
https://github.com/emutos/emutos/blob/89e2767aa3f1704e7e33c7ab1d6571ac84e4804d/bios/nova.c
Exact reference snapshot: vendor/emutos/nova.c. This additional adaptation
uses revision 89e2767aa3f1704e7e33c7ab1d6571ac84e4804d, not the older
revision listed above. Bus fault handling, bounded clock
validation, memory readback, black/white palette and output backend are local.
